#: scenario7:scenario7_89A6D2BA_A23B_4F01_B560_DA41FEB41DDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcec5e59a6161fe9bf42f3b5fb2cc79129a9d1be9bd6b2e50361142efb23eeb4
#. default-sha256: 7448e5d8c30013417510369e62dbef270fb1c17c664c08f2da989b38d4746a2b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89A6D2BA_A23B_4F01_B560_DA41FEB41DDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Heavy clouds filled the sky, blocking out the sun and giving the impression of late evening "
"all throughout the day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その日の太陽は分厚い雲で隠されていて、⟪k:1⟫夜を前にした気配が、⟪k:2⟫一日中続いていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA98D4F6_2D01_49A2_9CC9_08B6B91AF57B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bafde964792a935101e3c7b3a249e2b286808078e9b145d3028a66eb7d4bbd4
#. default-sha256: d805e3da4c6aeb4fb37797620546f11e1b795baf379f1962b9d62e0cd61a1ccf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA98D4F6_2D01_49A2_9CC9_08B6B91AF57B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Which meant I could only go outside on days when the weather made most everyone else gloomy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫外に出られる日は、⟪k:2⟫誰もが憂鬱になるような天気でないといけなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_62BE9474_951A_4850_AB0B_48F8BF4C4213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e77485bb753402faa4ed11c597374303e2f2e0a712a2cb9875de81cf2e1e6ad1
#. default-sha256: d5907ff331b9e4668e9ac4abb2f117a8abce057a1099a9f0a4c2aad755a87035
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_62BE9474_951A_4850_AB0B_48F8BF4C4213"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_43E1C2D0_3F06_485B_BCC9_00626FFF67B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cbc94a04552a5ff815587aebabfb27959450d4a94279801638900697d2072d5
#. default-sha256: de2c43ffc6edc7fb883fb1d5c328cb899b233a6d80aaca662fa9eb18f814fdea
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_43E1C2D0_3F06_485B_BCC9_00626FFF67B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A warm breeze blew past, sending up a swirl of flower petals."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫生ぬるい風が吹いて――⟪k:1⟫花が舞い上がる。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FE166405_06E9_48C9_B91E_7D545B24CDC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dca2c6856b850230e4f9422d8ac2ac03fe51eb65103b20da723ebefc0c6d2e3
#. default-sha256: 86c4255c2849b8d4b1aa88cee74f951bcc08eff75ea0e264de60c4aeb4eb2daa
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FE166405_06E9_48C9_B91E_7D545B24CDC6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The girl’s dress hung lightly over her frame, tracing her gentle curves."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女のまとう衣類が、⟪k:1⟫やわらかく肢体の稜線を撫でる。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CFB6B5B7_B005_45AD_AEAE_EF9562430783
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f892288868bbd17cdd03ac1b5892b56f00b6a3ae296e4b4ee637cc346b831c76
#. default-sha256: 72533d670e872d07b241e2c33d157fffb13e0a26d165822ab3d76b865565ba25
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CFB6B5B7_B005_45AD_AEAE_EF9562430783"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And you are?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫貴女は……？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E59D31B4_85C2_4732_A368_4E4D1F67B857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbc6df62548a8c02d2e00a7a52378ade6f7bc9a9a0600de9c6826c8fffd8ec0d
#. default-sha256: b0d832311ae7f26864c9b5ec10a0c8bd3ec2eb4ed8959f8252b660c6425e0e3d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E59D31B4_85C2_4732_A368_4E4D1F67B857"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My name is Aimee.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s a pleasure to finally meet you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私はエメよ、⟪k:2⟫……これからよろしくね。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F9079209_E85A_47FC_B2FA_F9843BD38D98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1384462716928ee9b1f9de0270b5408896010a4abb10bdfb29a730fc6a53d0de
#. default-sha256: 122511aaeb2937cae2b2d69d9e7a5cffcb27a6203445bfe7698963dc4931ca3f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F9079209_E85A_47FC_B2FA_F9843BD38D98"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫she stepped toward me, kissing me softly on the cheek."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は近づいて、⟪k:1⟫頬に口づけを落とした。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BDFDDAED_DC39_40E0_BAAC_48879F664DE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 707013a8444fadce98e154dca823634454cd5d8b5f243d9c38e4d8cf2452bbf6
#. default-sha256: 7c4e8e6ebee35f8d9e9889993378d562f5405f0ec58b4b4f3fea169aac2bdbe8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BDFDDAED_DC39_40E0_BAAC_48879F664DE0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Electrifyingly sweet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私を痺れさせた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_09505D2C_BFC5_4070_A5DF_6C8CB3F33C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 355bfdd9c5509c1262308b639444a5effb06ec3cefd4d7723d374e0edd9efecd
#. default-sha256: 7cbf434ee8864bd6d356e86e49cda7c4faec3c3fe159fa09e4910c8f835665d6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09505D2C_BFC5_4070_A5DF_6C8CB3F33C4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m Georges’s fiancée."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私、⟪k:2⟫ジョルジュと結婚するの。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0CC24CFF_DFBA_42EC_A670_E87AED53CB32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a21cf99460271e48c56e5eaff9c77135545fd9f30d17c670cc88772bec30ef7c
#. default-sha256: b56c6eb693c770935ed97880503984b1d1f94c7d286a38977eb80aa121bb06eb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0CC24CFF_DFBA_42EC_A670_E87AED53CB32"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it also"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7FC60674_11DD_464C_AB5F_B4B8A969DD1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b40f805c3546143532f17fde730b7e757765beee405d941fc9d7d0f6ccc92688
#. default-sha256: 5d194ee114119ea6e9426aac1e6da56b0f45b8965d9ce2bd2e4e851d35407c05
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7FC60674_11DD_464C_AB5F_B4B8A969DD1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫She was a noble girl by the name of Aimee Joubert. "
"⟪k:9⟫Though only fifteen, she was the very image of refined—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫polished to a shine."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫その人はエメ・ジュベールという貴族の娘だった。⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫十五になったばかりだが、⟪k:11⟫洗練された身のこなしをしていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CE727012_CD18_480E_AAB1_20A8B589F913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee41b4a88f55cf61b6c348c464a3580eb4d2854d881be09270bd23d35122d075
#. default-sha256: 9a11ac512a2906f8240aba180f29e64b5b2722fcd53c56bbedbf91d856ca8438
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CE727012_CD18_480E_AAB1_20A8B589F913"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It came out of nowhere, ⟪k:1⟫and it seemed I was the only one who didn’t know."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫晴天の霹靂だった。⟪k:1⟫私だけが知らなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4C7E4720_9197_41B4_925D_5BAB63DFAD73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e8d988998fc6ed6e8ebe022659443442d67370a60051ddf2c969618c6196bcc
#. default-sha256: ec995078e22deca307dd9b7d89efaec710fc6e9a8b120e23e95c2972b3a1a8e9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4C7E4720_9197_41B4_925D_5BAB63DFAD73"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That evening, when the family gathered around the table for supper, Aimee was there too. "
"⟪k:1⟫And they prepared an extravagant feast for the occasion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その日の夕刻は、⟪k:1⟫家族全員にエメが混ざり、⟪k:2⟫いつもより豪華な食卓が用意された。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2451AB79_1AEF_4C56_B230_8116FEE02F34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 191677b04dd74ee7bc0b2f5f856fadbb29ec62aaef324027be025b557f5f4d89
#. default-sha256: 510a99e3639c0462d15c047c34ab817c6eac1cc83961cffdd038cf96ec833798
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2451AB79_1AEF_4C56_B230_8116FEE02F34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was pleased to have another girl around."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母は男だらけの家に花が出来て、⟪k:1⟫喜んでいた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_64269743_0DF3_4D1E_9780_A9512BF3F822
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 938194574702040af8b621dbdfc04fc4e34808416472c31d8041692bf1c83460
#. default-sha256: b44c94d9b7794e4dd4dc14c5c258e6fb7a21e5ab81e7ac57eeb96289a40ecd8b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_64269743_0DF3_4D1E_9780_A9512BF3F822"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or, more specifically, she was relieved to have found someone other than my brothers for me "
"to spend time with."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫正確には、⟪k:1⟫私の相手をさせる人間が出来て、⟪k:2⟫安堵していたのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AFA09C65_DDDD_4F1D_8E4F_B475801780C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c3def0e63ddef849a9804fc15e5e94b80c74709b3006c548cc3a26e1217bebd
#. default-sha256: c137c1c677b5ac97288630e685b465b2e696e91a6b7643e667e3ac4db61bf88a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AFA09C65_DDDD_4F1D_8E4F_B475801780C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I felt much less... ⟪k:1⟫suffocated around her than my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女と過ごす時は、⟪k:1⟫母に感じていた閉塞感が存在しなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD5E8DB1_8AFB_4E85_A513_2395D28F0324
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db50c52895a57eec5ad59822e22269badc4ba54c9e0ce614fef42595fa7e30f2
#. default-sha256: 962369fade38962f4330ce0283933a1a72fba6ea55bf59bb0d84ccfdf10ca997
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD5E8DB1_8AFB_4E85_A513_2395D28F0324"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A din the likes of which I had never heard in my life filled the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫屋敷の大広間は、⟪k:1⟫私が今まで見てきた中で、⟪k:2⟫一番の盛り上がりを見せていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB6993ED_C256_4432_A9BF_47990377BB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 728cf155ed571144fe72158f48a250ef5913b7c6e1897da22b76f53060a4d756
#. default-sha256: 9569f8466277d78754065a4d572fb54212a03c1e79b8aca4ce6f07f317f3b76e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB6993ED_C256_4432_A9BF_47990377BB60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everywhere I looked, there were people, people, people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫見渡す限り、⟪k:1⟫人、⟪k:2⟫人、⟪k:3⟫人。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE3C5140_E779_4907_BA91_7508DDAFC3DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6fdd8dcc41921102d685a29fc3b0102b8fb5e6cd083e310dfd15d4c1d88a1bc
#. default-sha256: ff6e5b3e54aa99b23227d2fcd8fd914098ec6035ee170fd52c4a48283069618f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE3C5140_E779_4907_BA91_7508DDAFC3DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Voices from all directions."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫至るところで、⟪k:1⟫人の声がする。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9326FF57_90A9_44C3_9FA6_46CDCF4F59BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07d51c3ba53a519faea04c31fba8db5d1f4bb88a669d6621188ceb852fc63c97
#. default-sha256: 7f42032baa67d0fb445a62dc4b3728d8baa709e4e603954ff5a1fa0674596d83
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9326FF57_90A9_44C3_9FA6_46CDCF4F59BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Hey Dee, I feel like we’re critically short on waiters.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫This don’t look good for us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ねえねえ兄貴、⟪k:7⟫給仕の数、⟪k:8⟫足りてないんじゃない？⟪k:9⟫　"
"みっともないよ～、⟪k:10⟫これじゃ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4AB296AE_1FCD_47C1_AE8A_959666A52A0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07f08adbaf7d73db5fd3fc0ce25f797c70278799661702123ca7ebc41b908830
#. default-sha256: b4aa4d48b444f658d264299de0abdb701ea9b901c10f6524eb6e25086ff5bbf3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4AB296AE_1FCD_47C1_AE8A_959666A52A0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’re ⟪k:2⟫artistes⟪k:3⟫ like me. I met them at the court.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Let’s see, we "
"have some painters, composers, sculptors, troubadours, poets, writers, you name it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ええ～？⟪k:2⟫　宮廷で会った奴らだよ。⟪k:3⟫ぼくと同じ画家に、⟪k:4⟫音楽家、⟪k:5⟫彫刻家、"
"⟪k:6⟫それに詩人やら作家やら何やら……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_371CF7E6_AB99_46C2_A916_9B22E1E37DAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0bd0a5e7c0088b248d18551ef9ae8e4d632206d55e3a45c356dbc43938e7d03
#. default-sha256: b704a39d0304d21c8e2aab5eca604916896a93a78cc4d12ab92cbebae41b6277
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_371CF7E6_AB99_46C2_A916_9B22E1E37DAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫None of them have any connection to the Jouberts ⟪k:2⟫or⟪k:3⟫ Bollingers!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ジュベール家にもボランジェ家にも関係が無いではないか！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_03A91D8F_173E_4C91_B91D_251A71428750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c1fd41a103d13bf7dd7694e8843548d3e7a6fe8d9b7711ea0013e154d8e99f0
#. default-sha256: 22331f0f4c4e28cc307c29162dbecb63c269756968651eef3a84f29f1c5b973b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_03A91D8F_173E_4C91_B91D_251A71428750"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Off in one corner, several men—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫presumably Georges’s friends—"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫gathered in a circle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫大広間の一角には、⟪k:5⟫ジョルジュの友人と思われる一風変わった男たちもい"
"た。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BBBF8C7F_DC36_4327_B785_C5D10320209F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b56b29fcb85c6ec38c7f6e6d01d227f0ff9a948903358f6a4eeecdd134d52ede
#. default-sha256: 4981e9b43b2721f36ce06d56ca5fbe44655234a3a60f64ac3464c7fcce7cce07
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BBBF8C7F_DC36_4327_B785_C5D10320209F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They stood out from the other aristocrats, both in appearance and the air they gave off. "
"⟪k:1⟫The clothes they wore. The embroidery hidden beneath their jacket cuffs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他の貴族たちとは異なる雰囲気を漂わせている。⟪k:1⟫例えば服の着こなし方であったり、⟪k:2⟫袖口か"
"ら覗く刺繍ひとつであったり――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_01049DFE_0896_43B2_81A6_1E04BA9F3200
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ffdd4d307d05bed4a4e991c0fddf7d0736eb5fbc4a6d2535658da08937dd039
#. default-sha256: ee4164088c8b3d1afdc6e88f479cd5b182ad61db91b6cf29b81b8cc6cd008f00
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01049DFE_0896_43B2_81A6_1E04BA9F3200"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Their manner of speech. The way they held themselves. ⟪k:1⟫They were, simply put, a far cry "
"from the hardheaded Didier’s ideal party guests."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫言葉づかいや、⟪k:1⟫立ち振る舞いそのものであったり。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫要するに、⟪k:4⟫硬派なディディエ"
"には受け入れられない人種だった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B76385C_D544_4488_9F4C_9DA809AEB49F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
